{"id":92,"name":"الليل","transliteration":"Al-Layl","translation_fr":"La nuit","translation_en":"The Night","type":"meccan","total_verses":21,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا يَغۡشَىٰ","translation_fr":"Par la nuit quand elle enveloppe tout","translation_en":"By the night when it covers","transliteration":"Waallayli itha yaghsha"},{"id":2,"text":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Par le jour quand il éclaire","translation_en":"And [by] the day when it appears","transliteration":"Waalnnahari itha tajalla"},{"id":3,"text":"وَمَا خَلَقَ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"Et par ce qu'Il a créé, mâle et femelle","translation_en":"And [by] He who created the male and female","transliteration":"Wama khalaqa alththakara waalontha"},{"id":4,"text":"إِنَّ سَعۡيَكُمۡ لَشَتَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Vos efforts sont divergents","translation_en":"Indeed, your efforts are diverse","transliteration":"Inna saAAyakum lashatta"},{"id":5,"text":"فَأَمَّا مَنۡ أَعۡطَىٰ وَٱتَّقَىٰ","translation_fr":"Celui qui donne et craint (Allah)","translation_en":"As for he who gives and fears Allah","transliteration":"Faamma man aAAta waittaqa"},{"id":6,"text":"وَصَدَّقَ بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"et déclare véridique la plus belle récompense","translation_en":"And believes in the best [reward]","transliteration":"Wasaddaqa bialhusna"},{"id":7,"text":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلۡيُسۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Nous lui faciliterons la voie au plus grand bonheur","translation_en":"We will ease him toward ease","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilyusra"},{"id":8,"text":"وَأَمَّا مَنۢ بَخِلَ وَٱسۡتَغۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"Et quant à celui qui est avare, se dispense (de l'adoration d'Allah)","translation_en":"But as for he who withholds and considers himself free of need","transliteration":"Waamma man bakhila waistaghna"},{"id":9,"text":"وَكَذَّبَ بِٱلۡحُسۡنَىٰ","translation_fr":"et traite de mensonge la plus belle récompense","translation_en":"And denies the best [reward]","transliteration":"Wakaththaba bialhusna"},{"id":10,"text":"فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُۥ لِلۡعُسۡرَىٰ","translation_fr":"Nous lui faciliterons la voie à la plus grande difficulté","translation_en":"We will ease him toward difficulty","transliteration":"Fasanuyassiruhu lilAAusra"},{"id":11,"text":"وَمَا يُغۡنِي عَنۡهُ مَالُهُۥٓ إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ","translation_fr":"et à rien ne lui serviront ses richesses quand il sera jeté (au Feu)","translation_en":"And what will his wealth avail him when he falls","transliteration":"Wama yughnee AAanhu maluhu itha taradda"},{"id":12,"text":"إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا لَلۡهُدَىٰ","translation_fr":"C'est à Nous, certes, de guider","translation_en":"Indeed, [incumbent] upon Us is guidance","transliteration":"Inna AAalayna lalhuda"},{"id":13,"text":"وَإِنَّ لَنَا لَلۡأٓخِرَةَ وَٱلۡأُولَىٰ","translation_fr":"à Nous appartient, certes, la vie dernière et la vie présente","translation_en":"And indeed, to Us belongs the Hereafter and the first [life]","transliteration":"Wainna lana lalakhirata waaloola"},{"id":14,"text":"فَأَنذَرۡتُكُمۡ نَارٗا تَلَظَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Je vous ai donc avertis d'un Feu qui flambe","translation_en":"So I have warned you of a Fire which is blazing","transliteration":"Faanthartukum naran talaththa"},{"id":15,"text":"لَا يَصۡلَىٰهَآ إِلَّا ٱلۡأَشۡقَى","translation_fr":"où ne brûlera que le damné","translation_en":"None will [enter to] burn therein except the most wretched one","transliteration":"La yaslaha illa alashqa"},{"id":16,"text":"ٱلَّذِي كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"qui dément et tourne le dos","translation_en":"Who had denied and turned away","transliteration":"Allathee kaththaba watawalla"},{"id":17,"text":"وَسَيُجَنَّبُهَا ٱلۡأَتۡقَى","translation_fr":"alors qu'en sera écarté le pieux","translation_en":"But the righteous one will avoid it","transliteration":"Wasayujannabuha alatqa"},{"id":18,"text":"ٱلَّذِي يُؤۡتِي مَالَهُۥ يَتَزَكَّىٰ","translation_fr":"qui donne ses biens pour se purifier","translation_en":"[He] who gives [from] his wealth to purify himself","transliteration":"Allathee yutee malahu yatazakka"},{"id":19,"text":"وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِندَهُۥ مِن نِّعۡمَةٖ تُجۡزَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"et auprès de qui personne ne profite d'un bienfait intéressé","translation_en":"And not [giving] for anyone who has [done him] a favor to be rewarded","transliteration":"Wama liahadin AAindahu min niAAmatin tujza"},{"id":20,"text":"إِلَّا ٱبۡتِغَآءَ وَجۡهِ رَبِّهِ ٱلۡأَعۡلَىٰ","translation_fr":"mais seulement pour la recherche de La Face de son Seigneur le Très Haut","translation_en":"But only seeking the countenance of his Lord, Most High","transliteration":"Illa ibtighaa wajhi rabbihi alaAAla"},{"id":21,"text":"وَلَسَوۡفَ يَرۡضَىٰ","translation_fr":"Et certes, il sera bientôt satisfait","translation_en":"And he is going to be satisfied","transliteration":"Walasawfa yarda"}]}